yle=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(16,185,129,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#10b981;\">6 Tabs Info</span><span style=\"padding:3px 9px;border-radius:5px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.1);font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#dc2626;\">No CRUD</span></div></div></div>"
