        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Data Structure Merchant",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:3}\n• **General Information**: ID, Merchant Number, Merchant Name, Merchant Type, MCC, Currency, Registration Date, Limit Amount, Limit Currency.\n• **Contact & Address**: Communication Method, Communication Address, Country, Region, City, Street, House, Apartment, Postal Code, Place Code, Region Code.\n• **Card Information**: Card Number, Card Mask, Status, Sequential Number, Issue Date, Expiration Date, PIN Update, Previous Card Number, Product ID, Product Name, Card Limit.\n• **Customer Information**: Customer Number, Category, Nationality, Resident.\n• **Cardholder Information**: Cardholder Name, Surname, First Name, Second Name, Birthday, Place of Birth, Gender, ID Number, ID Issue Date, ID Expire Date.\n• **Account Information**: Account Number, Account Type, Account Status, Currency.",
          "color": "#0d9488",
          "bg": "#f0fdfa",
          "previewHtml": {
